    "description": "Dr Lal PathLabs International Enterprises is actively seeking a talented and motivated Senior Doctor to join our dynamic team in Coimbatore. This is an excellent opportunity for professionals who are passionate about making a real impact in a fast-growing organization.\n\nAbout Dr Lal PathLabs International Enterprises:\nDr Lal PathLabs International Enterprises is a leading organization in the Remote sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Monitor patient progress and adjust treatment plans accordingly\n• Respond to medical emergencies and provide immediate care\n• Maintain sterile environments and follow infection control protocols\n• Collaborate with pharmaceutical representatives and medical suppliers\n• Educate patients and families on health management and disease prevention\n• Participate in quality improvement initiatives and clinical audits\n• Coordinate with multidisciplinary teams for comprehensive patient management\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• MBA from a recognized university\n• 0-1 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in Patient Care\n• Proficiency in Wound Care\n• Proficiency in Medical Ethics\n• Proficiency in HIPAA Compliance\n• Proficiency in Diagnostic Skills\n• Proficiency in NABH Standards\n• Proficiency in Medical Coding\n• Proficiency in ICU Management\n\nWork Mode: Remote - Work from anywhere in India\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Annual paid leaves and casual leaves\n• Learning & development budget\n• International travel opportunities for senior roles\n• Flexible working hours\n• Referral bonus program\n• Provident Fund and Gratuity as per company policy\n• Salary Range: 2.5 LPA - 6 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Coimbatore, Tamil Nadu, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Dr Lal PathLabs International Enterprises!",
